Changes from the original (plugins/idle-compact):
  - On a headless host (Claude desktop app, SDK), where $.session.compact is
    refused, the compaction is queued as a /compact turn instead.
  - The prompt footer shows when the pending compaction will fire.
  - On Windows, a balloon announces a finished idle compaction
    (hooks/toast.ps1).
  - Person-facing text follows the system language (Chinese or English).
